{
  "verdict": "pass | fail | warn",
  "issues": [
    {
      "severity": "error | warning | info",
      "category": "completeness | clarity | testability | scope",
      "message": "description of the issue",
      "suggestion": "optional suggestion for fixing"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "human-readable summary of the assessment"
}

Verdict rules:
- "pass": No errors, no warnings. Document is ready for activation.
- "warn": No errors, but 1+ warnings. Document can proceed but has minor gaps.
- "fail": 1+ errors. Document must be revised before activation.
